    "**Discussion.** Read each justification. Notice that the model is doing real work: it pulls the *specific quote* (Vena's \"different starting point,\" Amy Hood's \"increase sequentially,\" Olsavsky's \$50B-vs-\$59B) and reasons from it. This is what makes LLM extraction more useful than a keyword search, it weighs context.\n",
