    "### The main table: signal vs. realized investment\n",
    "\n",
    "One row per firm, sorted from strongest *increase* signal to strongest *decrease*. This single table is the centerpiece of the exercise — it lets you eyeball whether the language and the dollars line up.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
